  x unknown filesystem property `subvolumes`
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-layout/repo.kdl:6:30]
 5 |         install {
 6 |             filesystem "xfs" subvolumes=#true pool="rpool"
   :                              ^^^^^^^^|^^^^^^^
   :                                      `-- not part of the schema
 7 |             var-disk "sdb"
   `----
  help: `filesystem` takes only its filesystem name

  x unknown filesystem property `pool`
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-layout/repo.kdl:6:47]
 5 |         install {
 6 |             filesystem "xfs" subvolumes=#true pool="rpool"
   :                                               ^^^^^^|^^^^^
   :                                                     `-- not part of the schema
 7 |             var-disk "sdb"
